<div class="content">
<h4 style="text-align: center;">Volunteer</h4>
<p style="text-align: center; color: #fff;">And Help Make It a Blessed Holiday</p>
<p style="text-align: center; color: #fff;" class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center"><a href="#volunteer" class="btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2">Learn More</a></p>
</div>
